\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\cf0  Cast worries and thoughts
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0 All pains and all worries
\par Upon the heart of Lord Jesus
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. When you're not yourself,
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0 And you're not at peace,
\par Cast all such upon your Saviour.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. He, with great mercy,
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0 And with much passion
\par will patiently, bear all your concerns.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. He's kind and gentle
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0 His blessings are sweet
\par And his message conveys peace to you.
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0 
\par \pard\fi-180\li315\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. He welcomes and cares,
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0 He never leaves you.
\par In death He holds you with safety
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li315\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6. When He becomes yours,
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0 He'll transport your soul
\par Unto His place of lasting rest,
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li315\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 7\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 7. Thus, ever be patient,
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0 E'en unto the end
\par \pard     And you will enjoy a life of peace.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

